SUMMARY:VIntage VIdeo Games
DESCRIPTION:\n\nCome experience nostalgic fun that spans over 30 years!  
 We’ll have several classic game consoles set up so adults can flash back 
 to their youth and kids can experience what parents used to play! Consoles 
 and games available from Atari\, Mattel\, Magnavox\, Coleco\, Nintendo\, 
 Sega\, Turbografx\, 3DO\, Playstation\, and Xbox. 20 systems in all 
 starting from the classic 1976 Atari Pong to the 2001 Xbox 
 original.\n\nChildren need to be accompanied by an adult. \n\nRegistration 
 required.
