SUMMARY:Spanish Storytime @MFCC
DESCRIPTION:Spanish Storytime takes place the second Thursday monthly.  
 \n\nJoin Ms. Jacqui for an engaging Spanish Storytime at the Milton Family 
 Community Center. Immerse your child in the beauty of the Spanish language 
 through captivating stories. Playgroup starts at 10:00 a.m. and the story 
 time will begin at 11:00 a.m. \n\n
