SUMMARY:Teen Movie Night
DESCRIPTION:For teens ages 13 – 18. Bring your friends for a fun movie 
 night and watch Project Hail Mary (2026).  Pizza and beverages provided. 
 Registration is required.\n\nProject Hail Mary (2026)\n\nDirected by Phil 
 Lord and Christopher Miller\n\nSynopsis:\n\nA science teacher wakes up 
 alone on a spaceship. As his memory returns\, he uncovers a mission to stop 
 a mysterious substance killing Earth's sun\, and realizes that an 
 unexpected friendship may be the key.\n\n
