SUMMARY:Holiday Open House
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate the holidays with us! Join us for storytime\, 
 crafts\, and delicious treats\, plus hot chocolate and coffee courtesy of 
 our Friends of the Library.  Snap a memorable photo with Santa and at our 
 Christmas photo booth and don’t forget to purchase raffle tickets for a 
 chance to win fabulous baskets in our Friends of the Library basket 
 raffle\, with the drawing happening on Tuesday\, December 15. Bring your 
 family and friends for a day of joy and holiday cheer.\n\n10:30 a.m. - 1:00 
 p.m. Refreshments - cookies\, hot cocoa and coffee provided by the Friends 
 of the Library\n10:30 a.m. - 12:00 p.m. Storytime with Santa/Pictures with 
 Santa\n10:30 a.m. - 1:00 p.m. Family Crafts\n10:30 a.m. - 1:00 p.m. Have 
 your picture taken at the photo booth banner \n\n\n
LOCATION:Library
