SUMMARY:Teen Advisory Group (TAG) Meeting
DESCRIPTION:Our Teen Advisory Group (TAG) meets the third Thursday 
 monthly.\n \n\nThe goal of TAG is to help promote our teen library services 
 and help create programming that encourages creativity by sharing ideas. In 
